  "Left Align": "左对齐",
  "Left click and drag the selection to move selected content.\nHold {0} to scale instead of move.\nRight click and drag the selection to rotate selected content.\nHold Shift to rotate in steps.\nUse arrow keys to move selected content by a single pixel.": "左键单击并拖动选择区域，以移动已选择的内容。\n按住 {0} 以缩放，而不是移动。\n右键单击并拖动选择区域，以旋转已选择的内容。\n按住 Shift 以逐级旋转。\n使用方向键将已选择的内容移动一像素。",
  "Left click and drag the selection to move selection outline.\nHold {0} to scale instead of move.\nRight click and drag the selection to rotate selection outline.\nHold Shift to rotate in steps.\nUse arrow keys to move selection outline by a single pixel.": "左键单击并拖动以移动选择区域的轮廓。\n按住 {0} 以缩放而不是移动。\n右键单击并拖动以旋转选择区域的轮廓。\n按住 Shift 以逐级旋转。\n使用方向键以移动选择区域的轮廓一像素。",
  "Left click to draw a shape with the primary color.\nLeft click on a shape to add a control point.\nLeft click on a control point and drag to move it.\nRight click on a control point and drag to change its tension.\nHold Shift to snap to angles.\nUse arrow keys to move the selected control point.\nPress {0} + left/right arrows to select control points by order.\nPress Delete to delete the selected control point.\nPress Space to add a new control point at the mouse position.\nHold {0} while pressing Space to create the control point at the exact same position.\nHold {0} while left clicking on a control point to create a new shape at the exact same position.\nPress Enter to finalize the shape.": "左键单击以绘制具有主颜色的椭圆。\n左键单击椭圆轮廓以添加控制点。\n左键单击控制点并拖动以控制形状。\n右键单击控制点并拖动以更改其张力。\n按住 Shift 键可绘制正圆。\n使用方向键移动选定的控制点。\n按 {0} + 向左/向右方向键按顺序选择控制点。\n按 Delete 键删除所选控制点。\n按空格键在鼠标位置添加新的控制点。\n按住 {0} 的同时按空格键可在完全相同的位置创建控制点。\n按住 {0} 同时左键单击控制点，以在完全相同的位置创建新形状。\n按 Enter 键完成形状。",
  "Left click to draw freeform one-pixel wide lines with the primary color.\nRight click to use the secondary color.": "左键单击并拖动以使用主颜色绘制一像素宽的自由线条。\n右键单击并拖动则使用次要颜色。",
  "Left click to draw with primary color, right click to draw with secondary color.": "左击使用主颜色绘制，右击使用副颜色绘制。",
  "Left click to erase to transparent, right click to erase to secondary color.": "左键点击擦除为透明色，右键点击擦除为副颜色",
  "Left click to fill a region with the primary color, right click to fill with the secondary color.\nHold Shift to use Global mode.": "左键单击用主颜色填充一个区域，右键单击则用副颜色。\n按住 Shift 键使用全局模式。",
  "Left click to place cursor, then type desired text. Text color is primary color.": "左击放置光标，然后键入所需的文本。文本颜色为主颜色。",
  "Left click to replace the secondary color with the primary color.\nRight click to reverse.": "左键单击将主颜色替换为副颜色。\n右键单击将副颜色替换为主颜色。",
  "Left click to set primary color.\nRight click to set secondary color.": "左键单击以设定主颜色。\n右键单击以设定次颜色。",
  "Left click to set primary color. Right click to set secondary color.": "左击设置主颜色，右击设置副颜色。",
  "Left click to set primary color. Right click to set secondary color. Middle click or press {0} and left click to choose palette color.": "左键单击设置主颜色。右键单击设置副颜色。使用鼠标中键或按住 {0} 再点击以选择调色盘颜色。",
  "Left click to zoom in.\nRight click to zoom out.\nClick and drag to zoom in selection.": "左键单击以放大。\n右键单击以缩小。\n点击并拖拽以缩放至该范围。",
